# 4. Major Components of Investigation Module

## 4.1 Repository Scanner

### Purpose

The Repository Scanner is the entry point of the system.

It scans the complete repository and collects information about files and folders.

### Responsibilities

* Traverse directories
* Identify project files
* Ignore unnecessary files
* Collect metadata

### Input

Repository path

### Output

List of files:

```
[
src/App.js,
package.json,
database/schema.sql,
README.md
]
```

### Technologies

* Node.js
* TypeScript
* File System APIs

---

