# 7. Escalation Rules

The Investigation Module must identify situations where human or higher-level agent intervention is required.

Examples:

## Unknown Technology

If the system finds an unsupported framework:

```
Unknown framework detected

Action:
Request additional analysis
```

---

## Missing Configuration

Example:

```
package.json missing

Action:
Escalate to user
```

---

## Large Repository

If repository size is very large:

```
Use incremental scanning
```

